<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="ISO-8859-1" />
        <title>Edge cases for the syntax highlighting</title>
    </head>
    <body>
<h1 id="edge-cases-for-the-syntax-highlighting">Edge cases for the syntax highlighting</h1>
<p>snake_case_names stay plain, 2<em>3</em>4 is emphasis, <em>a <strong>b</strong> c</em> nests.
Unmatched ** markers and a lone * star, *escaped* too.
Code <code>with ` backtick</code> and <code>*no emphasis* &lt;b&gt;inside&lt;/b&gt;</code>.
Mail <a href="mailto:someone@example.com">someone@example.com</a>, entity &amp; and a <a href="http://example.com" title="Title">ref link</a>.</p>
<pre><code>inside a tilde fence: **not bold**
```
still inside
</code></pre>
<pre><code>indented code (not highlighted)
</code></pre>
<blockquote>
<p>quote with <strong>bold</strong> and <code>code</code></p>
<blockquote>
<p>nested quote</p>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<ol>
<li>other list marker</li>
</ol>
<ol start="10">
<li>two digits</li>
</ol>
<h1 id="setext-heading">Setext heading</h1>
<h2 id="setext-h2">Setext h2</h2>

    </body>
</html>
